  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 205.02 Procedure. The procedures for an adjudicative hearing shall be as specified in RSA 541-A and the provisions of Env-C 200 that are applicable to adjudicative hearings.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Dw 200) #10607, eff 6-1-14\n\nAppendix",
